			"notes": "# Release Notes - InstantBrew v1.0\n\n## Overview\nInstantBrew is a Fabric mod for Minecraft 26.2 that allows players to configure the brewing speed of potions via an in-game config screen.\n\n---\n\n## Features\n- Configurable brew time from 1 tick (instant) to 400 ticks (vanilla)\n- In-game configuration screen with Mod Menu integration\n- Toggle mod on/off without restarting\n- Config saved to `config/instantbrew.json`\n\n---\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or later\n- Java 25 or later\n- Fabric API (latest)\n\n### Optional\n- Mod Menu (for in-game config access)\n\n---\n\n## Changes in v1.0\n- Initial release\n- Configurable brew time (1-400 ticks)\n- Cloth Config integration (bundled)\n- Mod Menu integration\n\n---\n\n## Installation\n1. Place the `.jar` file in your `mods` folder\n2. Launch Minecraft 26.2 with Fabric Loader\n3. Configure via Mod Menu or edit `config/instantbrew.json`\n\n---\n\n## Feedback\nReport issues at: https://github.com/yourusername/InstantBrew/issues"
		}
